{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b1eefc15-d102-8977-a454-49464aaed493",
  "created_at": "2026-02-06T10:33:44-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniela Castillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:31:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:31:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Daniela Castillo. I am calling about a streetlight. The light is directly outside a property I own, and it shines straight into the bedroom window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:32:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it a new light, or has it always been that bright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:32:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It changed. Before, it was dim and yellow. Now it is white and very strong. The light comes through the blinds and lights the whole room."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:32:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Sometimes they swap the fixture and it throws light differently. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:32:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The address is 111 Old Beach Road. It is the pole in front, near the edge of the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:32:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "111 Old Beach Road, near Easton's Beach. Is there a number on the pole, a little tag or sticker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:32:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have not looked. I was up late reading last night, and I am still a little groggy this morning. I can check the pole and call you back with the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:32:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need to go out in the cold yet. The address should be enough to find it. What are you asking for exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:33:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would like a crew to check the pole. Please see whether the fixture is correct, and whether it can be shielded or adjusted so it does not point at the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:33:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in a work order for a crew to inspect it. Can I get a number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:33:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0175."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:33:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-five. And it's Castillo, C-A-S-T-I-L-L-O?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:33:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Two L's at the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:33:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. They usually get to these within a couple of weeks, sometimes sooner. If it gets worse or the light starts flickering, call us back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:33:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That is all I need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:33:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Castillo. Have a good weekend."
    }
  ],
